================================================================================
 WHAT THIS PROJECT IS, AND WHAT IT IS NOT
================================================================================

POP de Elite is a drafting aid for institutional quality documents. It is not a
medical device and it is not validated for clinical use. It does not diagnose,
prescribe or decide clinical management.

Every document it produces is a technical draft. The institution's own team
must review, adapt and approve it before any use; signature fields are left
blank on purpose. A consent form produced by it is always a template.

It does not accept patient data. Do not type, record or attach names, medical
record numbers, identified exams or photographs of patients.

The language model is not ours: conversation and document content are produced
by Google Gemini, called by the backend in this repository, which also holds the
instructions given to the model. The knowledge base it consults on
radioterapia.ai is not part of this repository; the tests use a short fictitious
one.

